      "solution": "n = int(input())\nv = [1000,900,500,400,100,90,50,40,10,9,5,4,1]\ns = [\"M\",\"CM\",\"D\",\"CD\",\"C\",\"XC\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"X\",\"IX\",\"V\",\"IV\",\"I\"]\nfor _ in range(n):\n    x = int(input())\n    r = \"\"\n    for a,b in zip(v,s):\n        r += b*(x//a)\n        x %= a\n    print(r)",
